# 3. Non-Negotiable Development Rule

We build in very small verified increments.

For every increment:

``` text
PLAN
 ↓
IMPLEMENT
 ↓
RUN
 ↓
TEST
 ↓
VERIFY RESULT
 ↓
FIX IF NEEDED
 ↓
RETEST
 ↓
INSPECT GIT DIFF
 ↓
COMMIT WORKING STATE
 ↓
NEXT INCREMENT
```

Never stack several untested features.

Never trust an AI statement that something works.

A feature is complete only when we have personally run and verified it.

------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 4. Branch Safety

Massi develops on:

`dev`

Do not implement Massi's unfinished work directly on `main`.

Before every work session:

``` bash
git checkout dev
git pull origin dev
git status
```

Before starting a major new increment, also check whether `main`
contains team changes that Massi needs.

Do not merge blindly.

Before every commit:

``` bash
git status
git diff
```

Check:

-   no secrets
-   no `.env`
-   no accidental unrelated files
-   no teammate files modified unnecessarily
-   no API contract changed accidentally

Then commit the smallest working increment.

Only merge/push stable integrated work to `main` when the team is ready.

