## PHASE 5 --- Bob Task 02: Investigation Engine Plan + Implementation

### Goal

Build Massi's main component:

`backend/services/investigation.py`

The engine takes an issue and repository context and returns structured
engineering reasoning.

### Minimum workflow

``` text
Issue
 ↓
Normalize/validate input
 ↓
Inspect repository files
 ↓
Rank/select relevant files
 ↓
Inspect relevant code
 ↓
Determine likely root cause
 ↓
Generate repair recommendation
 ↓
Generate regression-test recommendation
 ↓
Return structured result
```

### MVP principle

It does NOT need to debug every repository on Earth.

It must reliably solve the controlled RepoMedic workflow and degrade
safely for unknown problems.

### Bob usage --- HEAVY

This is one of the best places to spend Bobcoins.

Workflow:

1.  Bob Plan on this bounded component.
2.  ChatGPT + Massi review Bob's proposed design.
3.  Bob Agent implements only approved files.
4.  Massi inspects `git diff`.
5.  Run focused tests.
6.  Give failures back to Bob only when repository-aware debugging is
    valuable.
7.  Capture Bob session evidence.

### Files Bob may primarily modify

``` text
backend/services/investigation.py
backend/models/schemas.py
tests/test_investigation.py
```

Possibly the investigation API later, but keep service logic separate
first.

### Required cases

